d repopulates the entire index map anyway."], "suggestions": ["In removeValue(): change "Comparable key = (Comparable) this.keys.remove(index);\n        this.values.remove(index);\n        this.indexMap.remove(key);\n        if (index < this.keys.size()) {\n            rebuildIndex();\n        }" to "this.keys.remove(index);\n        this.values.remove(index);\n        rebuildIndex();" because removing any element requires rebuilding the index map for all subsequent shifted keys."], "problematic_lines": [313, 314, 315, 316, 317, 318, 319], "test_status_observed": "FAIL", "prompt_tokens": 9003, "candidate_tokens": 383, "total_tokens": 9386, "is_multi_file": true}}]

