     * Sets the renderer at index 0 (sometimes referred to as the "primary" 
     * renderer) and sends a {@link PlotChangeEvent} to all registered 
     * listeners.
     *
     * @param renderer  the renderer (<code>null</code> permitted.
     * 
     * @see #getRenderer()
     */
