     * Abstracts away the similarities between visiting the unknown type and the
     * all type.
     * @param topType {@code UNKNOWN_TYPE} or {@code ALL_TYPE}
     * @return the restricted type
     * @see #caseAllType
     * @see #caseUnknownType
     */
